{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CexFvXXX5Y8z8GVV4TA5b","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HDKGp6za3SbGmu4KD2KgcK","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Add shipment confirm endpoint tests","prompt":"Add comprehensive tests to ShipmentControllerTest.kt to verify the new confirm endpoint functionality. The test file is located at:\n/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-1a8cbbfb-17f7-4379-9a7e-1468fe93997a/sample-service/src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentControllerTest.kt\n\nAdd the following tests BEFORE the closing brace of the class:\n\n1. Test that confirming a CREATED shipment moves it to CONFIRMED:\n   - Create a shipment with status CREATED\n   - POST to /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm\n   - Assert response status is 200 OK\n   - Assert returned shipment has status CONFIRMED\n   - Verify the status is persisted by fetching it again\n\n2. Test that confirming an already CONFIRMED shipment succeeds and changes nothing:\n   - Confirm a shipment twice\n   - Both calls should succeed with 200 OK\n   - The second confirm should return the same CONFIRMED status\n   - This tests idempotency for retries\n\n3. Test that confirming a CANCELLED shipment is rejected with 409:\n   - Create a shipment and manually set it to CANCELLED in the repository (don't use an endpoint)\n   - POST to /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm\n   - Assert response status is 409 Conflict\n   - Assert error code is SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM_CANCELLED\n\n4. Test that confirming a non-existent shipment returns 404:\n   - POST to /shipments/S-nonexistent/confirm\n   - Assert response status is 404 Not Found\n   - Assert error code is SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND\n\nUse MockMvc to perform the requests, follow the existing test patterns in the file, and use the same imports and style. The endpoint path is /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm with POST method.","isolation":"worktree"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":631,"cache_read_input_tokens":46360,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":631},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"10e90c4d-b2ad-4128-a8cc-34e49d0aaf5a","uuid":"c4642e29-5a48-41c4-99bc-13e0580c124a","timestamp":"2026-09-11T20:09:27.697Z","request_id":"req_011CexFvWyGUWq6UExDwktt6","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01HDKGp6za3SbGmu4KD2KgcK":{"description":"Add shipment confirm endpoint tests","prompt":"Add comprehensive tests to ShipmentControllerTest.kt to verify the new confirm endpoint functionality. The test file is located at:\n/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-1a8cbbfb-17f7-4379-9a7e-1468fe93997a/sample-service/src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentControllerTest.kt\n\nAdd the following tests BEFORE the closing brace of the class:\n\n1. Test that confirming a CREATED shipment moves it to CONFIRMED:\n   - Create a shipment with status CREATED\n   - POST to /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm\n   - Assert response status is 200 OK\n   - Assert returned shipment has status CONFIRMED\n   - Verify the status is persisted by fetching it again\n\n2. Test that confirming an already CONFIRMED shipment succeeds and changes nothing:\n   - Confirm a shipment twice\n   - Both calls should succeed with 200 OK\n   - The second confirm should return the same CONFIRMED status\n   - This tests idempotency for retries\n\n3. Test that confirming a CANCELLED shipment is rejected with 409:\n   - Create a shipment and manually set it to CANCELLED in the repository (don't use an endpoint)\n   - POST to /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm\n   - Assert response status is 409 Conflict\n   - Assert error code is SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM_CANCELLED\n\n4. Test that confirming a non-existent shipment returns 404:\n   - POST to /shipments/S-nonexistent/confirm\n   - Assert response status is 404 Not Found\n   - Assert error code is SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND\n\nUse MockMvc to perform the requests, follow the existing test patterns in the file, and use the same imports and style. The endpoint path is /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm with POST method.","isolation":"worktree"}}}
