{"type":"system","subtype":"task_started","task_id":"af73141e4ad75836e","tool_use_id":"toolu_01J32gFo6CdJbPedX2CJeRTu","description":"Add confirm endpoint to ShipmentController","subagent_type":"general-purpose","is_backgrounded":false,"spawn_depth":2,"task_type":"local_agent","prompt":"You need to modify the ShipmentController.kt file to add a new confirm endpoint. The file is located at:\n/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-1a8cbbfb-17f7-4379-9a7e-1468fe93997a/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentController.kt\n\nAdd a new method called `confirm` as follows - insert it before the closing brace of the class:\n\n```kotlin\n@PostMapping(\"/{shipmentId}/confirm\")\nfun confirm(@PathVariable shipmentId: String): Shipment {\n    val shipment = repository.findById(shipmentId)\n        ?: throw ResourceNotFoundException(\n            ErrorCode.SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND,\n            \"No shipment with id '$shipmentId'\",\n        )\n\n    return when (shipment.status) {\n        ShipmentStatus.CREATED -> {\n            val confirmed = shipment.copy(status = ShipmentStatus.CONFIRMED)\n            repository.save(confirmed)\n        }\n        ShipmentStatus.CONFIRMED -> shipment\n        ShipmentStatus.CANCELLED -> {\n            throw ConflictException(\n                ErrorCode.SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM_CANCELLED,\n                \"Cannot confirm a cancelled shipment with id '$shipmentId'\",\n            )\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\nUse bash commands or appropriate tools to modify the file. After making the changes, read the file back to verify the changes were applied correctly and report back with confirmation.","uuid":"b3dab2bd-703d-434e-995d-df99d75aa4bf","session_id":"10e90c4d-b2ad-4128-a8cc-34e49d0aaf5a"}
