{"type":"system","subtype":"task_started","task_id":"aa337b377b2f9cb36","tool_use_id":"toolu_01JmJsmcZYz1Ub861WctvWVZ","description":"Modify ShipmentController.kt to add confirm endpoint","subagent_type":"general-purpose","is_backgrounded":true,"spawn_depth":3,"task_type":"local_agent","prompt":"You need to modify the ShipmentController.kt file located at:\n/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-1a8cbbfb-17f7-4379-9a7e-1468fe93997a/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentController.kt\n\nAdd the following new method before the closing brace of the ShipmentController class:\n\n```kotlin\n@PostMapping(\"/{shipmentId}/confirm\")\nfun confirm(@PathVariable shipmentId: String): Shipment {\n    val shipment = repository.findById(shipmentId)\n        ?: throw ResourceNotFoundException(\n            ErrorCode.SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND,\n            \"No shipment with id '$shipmentId'\",\n        )\n\n    return when (shipment.status) {\n        ShipmentStatus.CREATED -> {\n            val confirmed = shipment.copy(status = ShipmentStatus.CONFIRMED)\n            repository.save(confirmed)\n        }\n        ShipmentStatus.CONFIRMED -> shipment\n        ShipmentStatus.CANCELLED -> {\n            throw ConflictException(\n                ErrorCode.SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM_CANCELLED,\n                \"Cannot confirm a cancelled shipment with id '$shipmentId'\",\n            )\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\nThe method should be inserted before the closing brace (currently on line 56). Make sure to maintain proper indentation to match the existing code style.\n\nAfter making the changes, read the entire file to verify the changes were applied correctly and report back what you did.","uuid":"5b082091-e720-4659-a6db-9f16db9f061b","session_id":"10e90c4d-b2ad-4128-a8cc-34e49d0aaf5a"}
