d(@PathVariable shipmentId: String): Shipment =\n        repository.findById(shipmentId)\n            ?: throw ResourceNotFoundException(\n                ErrorCode.SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND,\n                \"No shipment with id '$shipmentId'\",\n            )\n\n    @GetMapping\n    fun list(): List<Shipment> = repository.findAll()\n\n    @PostMapping(\"/{shipmentId}/confirm\")\n    fun confirm(@PathVariable shipmentId: String): Shipment {\n        val shipment = repository.findById(shipmentId)\n            ?: throw ResourceNotFoundException(\n                ErrorCode.SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND,\n                \"No shipment with id '$shipmentId'\",\n            )\n\n        return when (shipment.status) {\n            ShipmentStatus.CREATED -> {\n                val confirmed = shipment.copy(status = ShipmentStatus.CONFIRMED)\n                repository.save(confirmed)\n            }\n            ShipmentStatus.CONFIRMED -> shipment\n            ShipmentStatus.CANCELLED -> {\n                throw ConflictException(\n                    ErrorCode.SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM_CANCELLED,\n                    \"Cannot confirm a cancelled shipment with id '$shipmentId'\",\n                )\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**File location:** `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-1a8cbbfb-17f7-4379-9a7e-1468fe93997a/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentController.kt`\n\nThis complete file includes:\n- Package declaration\n- All 13 imports\n- The create method (unchanged)\n- The getById method (unchanged)\n- The list method (unchanged)\n- The NEW confirm method that implements the BE-003 requirements\n- The closing brace of the class\n\nThe confirm method:\n- Takes `shipmentId` as a path parameter\n- Retrieves the shipment, throwing `ResourceNotFoundException` with `SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND` if not found\n- Returns the shipment unchanged if already CONFIRMED (idempotent)\n- Updates status to CONFIRMED if current